      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِتْيَهٌ</span></b>  A man <i>having much</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِيه</span> [meaning <i>pride,</i>
or <i>conceit,</i> or <i>vanity</i>]: or <i>who deviates from,</i> or
<i>loses,</i> or <i>misses, the right way,</i> or <i>who loses his
way, much,</i> or <i>often.</i> (TA.)

